{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ta-daah!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2424240/extras/f5694fac7a51429451a96be844116692.avif?t=1765973453\" width=240 height=240 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I'm Cygnus, the Great Sage living at the edge of the forest!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One day, the demon lord suddenly appeared in the peaceful kingdom of Corvus!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2424240/extras/74f05fd58ec2bffb8bcd056da2627e66.avif?t=1765973453\" width=240 height=240 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The king and everyone else in the kingdom have all perished! What should we do!?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ah! There's Sir Lyra!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Isn't that Sir Lyra, the loyal knight of the kingdom?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Let's defeat the demon lord together!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I have a secret weapon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's called the...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2424240/extras/314cce072bd4341c9e12afc90ff70ad1.avif?t=1765973453\" width=640 height=480 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >----</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Pudding: Lyre Knight</i> is the 13th title in the Katatema series, a unique and thrilling action-adventure of destruction!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* Minimal buttons! A simple control scheme.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* Deal with terrifying attacks easily using tools like the Happiness Ring!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* Designed to be fun and easy to play, even for those not skilled in shooting games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* Collect items as you play and admire them in the collection room.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* A gradually unfolding world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* A reliable companion always by your side.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* The music is all new tracks by Watson, and the soundtrack is also available.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >----</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're welcome to stream this game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please avoid major spoilers in the thumbnails.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Excellent Tutorial","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2424240/1cb9cf236c67da8feef08f8a240d508f30111a50.jpg"},{"name":"Sweet Treat","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2424240/86b833706f72c858dce4929d73219058b5683693.jpg"},{"name":"Daydream","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2424240/170b9cd1150c7a5ef79747c7caffc810100b950e.jpg"},{"name":"Perfect Daydream","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2424240/f0511e00dda4476b26650683a405d9fad39441d2.jpg"},{"name":"A Bit of Junk","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2424240/2752c977203b8f349552e85b2971fea9068a11a1.jpg"},{"name":"A Fair Amount of Junk","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2424240/aaaff32cc97e404d68ce22be9e4146d58d6ce3ec.jpg"},{"name":"A Lot of Treasures","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2424240/ce206e77309091df47d508b199d0d846ab3d8885.jpg"},{"name":"Nearly All Treasures","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steam